{{!
    @template tool_vae/deposit_digest

    The beginning of the digest of a deposit, as code: a cell of the table of the deposits.

    The text comes from the context, given by tool_vae\output\deposit_digest. The template holds no logic. The digest is
    escaped (double braces): it is not HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * digest - string, the beginning of the digest

    Example context (json):
    {
        "digest": "3f2a9c41b07e"
    }
}}
<code>{{digest}}</code>
